  TokenizerPopulationAdmitted, TokenizerPopulationRefused, TokenizerVocabulary, TokenizerPromptEncoding, TokenizerSpecialTokens, TokenizerGenerationDefaults, RoleNotConsumedByRuntime, RoleNoSeparateFile, RolePublishedFile,
